{"3957640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "RIP Love: A Story of Pain", "steam_appid": 3957640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>🖤 About the Game</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">RIP Love: A Story of Pain</span></strong> is a narrative-driven experience where players don’t choose their own path, but instead live through a carefully written story full of emotions, heartbreak, and self-discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional branching games, this title offers a single, immersive storyline that unfolds step by step, allowing the player to fully feel the intended atmosphere without distractions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>🎮 Gameplay</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear narrative: No branching choices – one carefully crafted story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive experience: Focus on atmosphere, visuals, and storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic style: Progress through scenes that reflect the emotional journey of the protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>🌍 Supported Languages</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is fully localized into 12 languages:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >العربية (Arabic)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Français (French)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >日本語 (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >한국어 (Korean)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deutsch (German)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >हिंदी (Hindi)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >اردو (Urdu)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Русский (Russian)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Türkçe (Turkish)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Português (Portuguese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Español (Spanish)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>✨ Key Features</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique storytelling experience with no gameplay distractions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully designed visuals and soundtracks to support the emotional tone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessible worldwide with 12 fully supported languages.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>🖤 About the Game</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">RIP Love: A Story of Pain</span></strong> is a narrative-driven experience where players don’t choose their own path, but instead live through a carefully written story full of emotions, heartbreak, and self-discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional branching games, this title offers a single, immersive storyline that unfolds step by step, allowing the player to fully feel the intended atmosphere without distractions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>🎮 Gameplay</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear narrative: No branching choices – one carefully crafted story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive experience: Focus on atmosphere, visuals, and storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic style: Progress through scenes that reflect the emotional journey of the protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>🌍 Supported Languages</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is fully localized into 12 languages:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >العربية (Arabic)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Français (French)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >日本語 (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >한국어 (Korean)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deutsch (German)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >हिंदी (Hindi)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >اردو (Urdu)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Русский (Russian)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Türkçe (Turkish)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Português (Portuguese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Español (Spanish)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>✨ Key Features</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique stor